[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 89.",
    "start": 1.55,
    "end": 3.902,
    "zh": "第89课。",
    "zh_hant": "第89課。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "For sale.",
    "start": 3.952,
    "end": 5.012,
    "zh": "出售。",
    "zh_hant": "出售。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 6.173,
    "end": 9.734,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Why couldn't Nigel decide?",
    "start": 11.936,
    "end": 14.537,
    "zh": "为什么奈杰尔无法决定？",
    "zh_hant": "為什麼奈傑爾無法決定？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Good afternoon.",
    "start": 16.798,
    "end": 17.978,
    "zh": "下午好。",
    "zh_hant": "下午好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "I believe that this house is for sale.",
    "start": 18.259,
    "end": 21.04,
    "zh": "我相信这栋房子是出售的。",
    "zh_hant": "我相信這棟房子是出售的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "That's right.",
    "start": 22.081,
    "end": 23.381,
    "zh": "没错。",
    "zh_hant": "沒錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "May I have a look at it, please?",
    "start": 24.482,
    "end": 26.783,
    "zh": "我可以看看吗？",
    "zh_hant": "我可以看看嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Yes, of course.",
    "start": 28.384,
    "end": 30.124,
    "zh": "是的，当然。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，當然。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Come in.",
    "start": 30.385,
    "end": 31.405,
    "zh": "请进。",
    "zh_hant": "請進。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "How long have you lived here?",
    "start": 32.866,
    "end": 34.947,
    "zh": "你在这里住了多久了？",
    "zh_hant": "你在這裡住了多久了？"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "I've lived here for twenty years.",
    "start": 35.907,
    "end": 38.648,
    "zh": "我在这里住了二十年了。",
    "zh_hant": "我在這裡住了二十年了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Twenty years!",
    "start": 39.849,
    "end": 41.61,
    "zh": "二十年！",
    "zh_hant": "二十年！"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "That's a long time.",
    "start": 41.691,
    "end": 43.991,
    "zh": "那是很长的时间。",
    "zh_hant": "那是很長的時間。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Yes, I've been here since 1976.",
    "start": 44.632,
    "end": 50.705,
    "zh": "是的，我从1976年就一直在这里。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，我從1976年就一直在這裡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Then why do you want to sell it?",
    "start": 50.755,
    "end": 53.356,
    "zh": "那你为什么要卖掉它？",
    "zh_hant": "那你為什麼要賣掉它？"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Because I've just retired.",
    "start": 54.337,
    "end": 57.098,
    "zh": "因为我刚刚退休了。",
    "zh_hant": "因為我剛剛退休了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "I want to buy a small house in the country.",
    "start": 57.618,
    "end": 61.08,
    "zh": "我想在乡下买一座小房子。",
    "zh_hant": "我想在鄉下買一座小房子。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "How much does this house cost?",
    "start": 62.881,
    "end": 65.042,
    "zh": "这栋房子多少钱？",
    "zh_hant": "這棟房子多少錢？"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "￡68, 500.",
    "start": 67.23,
    "end": 71.395,
    "zh": "六万八千五百英镑。",
    "zh_hant": "六萬八千五百英鎊。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "That's a lot of money!",
    "start": 71.445,
    "end": 73.606,
    "zh": "那是很多钱！",
    "zh_hant": "那是很多錢！"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "It's worth every penny of it.",
    "start": 74.507,
    "end": 76.707,
    "zh": "它值这个价钱。",
    "zh_hant": "它值這個價錢。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Well, I like the house,",
    "start": 77.928,
    "end": 80.429,
    "zh": "嗯，我喜欢这栋房子，",
    "zh_hant": "嗯，我喜歡這棟房子，"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "but I can't decide yet.",
    "start": 80.35,
    "end": 82.734,
    "zh": "但我还不能决定。",
    "zh_hant": "但我還不能決定。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "My wife must see it first.",
    "start": 83.216,
    "end": 85.84,
    "zh": "我妻子必须先看看。",
    "zh_hant": "我妻子必須先看看。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "Women always have the last word.",
    "start": 86.964,
    "end": 90.25,
    "zh": "女人总是有最后发言权。",
    "zh_hant": "女人總是有最後發言權。"
  }
]
